<package name="xpumanager" project="openSUSE:Factory">
  <title>Intel(R) XPU Manager and XPU System Management Interface</title>
  <description>Intel(R) XPU Manager is a free and open-source tool for monitoring and managing Intel Data Center GPUs. It is designed to simplify administration, and to help in improving device utilization and maximizing their reliability and uptime. Intel(R) XPU System Management Interface (XPU-SMI) is a command line interface (CLI) to manage GPUs locally.</description>
  <url>https://github.com/intel/xpumanager</url>
</package>
